        "created_at": "2014-08-19T00:20:39.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>this might be a rather randmom question but im still curious to ask you guys here. My friends and i usually choose to play the game trying to stay Thamatic to the sentinel's world but every once in a while we liketo branch out.</p><p>so my question is: is it alright to play a scenario with a mixed team? for example, lets take scenario 1-power theft. In the scenario the setup says 2-4 hero players and 1 villian player. Baron Blade would be the scenario villain of course but is it okay if the players who choose to fight against Baron Blade chose a vliian to fight&nbsp; along with the heros? for instance, The Wraith, Unity, Ambuscade, and Bunker VS Baron Blade? would the game still be balanced?</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:42:14.762Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
